tool=vision
	description='What is in a picture, from vision(4) at /mnt/vision'
	authorities='reads_fs'
	notes='The picture goes only to whatever server is mounted at /mnt/vision, the fixed-function grant this tool alone receives; no network egress of its own, no credentials, never /mnt/video. The grant is the whole mount, so the tool can also write its ctl (load or unload a model).'
